{"n":17,"title":"People-watching","blurb":"Описывать людей","steps":[{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"note","title":"People-watching","sub":"","html":"<p>Описываем людей: японские майко, мужчина в жёлтой футболке и твои друзья.</p><ul class=\"cp-aims\"><li>Описывать внешность</li><li>Описывать характер</li><li>Ставить слова в правильном порядке</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Warm-up","type":"pick","title":"Выберите слова, которые знаете.","sub":"Здесь нет неправильного ответа.","options":[{"label":"tall"},{"label":"young"},{"label":"friendly"},{"label":"funny"},{"label":"quiet"},{"label":"clever"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"hair","ru":"волосы","kk":"шаш","def":"She has long black hair.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/709ba5aaa231.mp3"},{"en":"eyes","ru":"глаза","kk":"көздер","def":"He has green eyes.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/577edc67ce8a.mp3"},{"en":"face","ru":"лицо","kk":"бет","def":"The Maiko have white faces.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/60b557732d14.mp3"},{"en":"head","ru":"голова","kk":"бас","def":"Flowers on top of their heads.","img":null,"audio":"/course/a0/audio/48e9c85d1e52.mp3"}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите слово.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/028f821e1f18.mp3","options":["hand","arm","leg"],"answer":"arm","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите слово.","sub":"","prompt":"","src":"/course/a0/audio/1c8884169ed6.mp3","options":["face","foot","hair"],"answer":"foot","html":""},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"tall","ru":"высокий","kk":"ұзын бойлы","def":"He's a tall young man.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/09649207a9b5.mp3"},{"en":"short","ru":"невысокий / короткий","kk":"аласа / қысқа","def":"She has short hair.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a0f4ea7d9149.mp3"},{"en":"young","ru":"молодой","kk":"жас","def":"A young woman.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/ee97d2f28ccf.mp3"},{"en":"old","ru":"пожилой / старый","kk":"егде / ескі","def":"My grandfather is old.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/c00dbbc9dadf.mp3"},{"en":"good-looking","ru":"привлекательный","kk":"келбетті","def":"He's a good-looking man.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"match","title":"Соедините противоположные слова.","sub":"","pairs":[{"left":"tall","right":"short"},{"left":"young","right":"old"},{"left":"long hair","right":"short hair"},{"left":"quiet","right":"funny"}],"options":["old","short","short hair","funny"]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"friendly","ru":"дружелюбный","kk":"достық ниетті","def":"Morocco's a friendly country.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/41209342f361.mp3"},{"en":"funny","ru":"смешной","kk":"күлкілі","def":"Birdman's a funny film.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/bf48095db4e1.mp3"},{"en":"clever","ru":"умный","kk":"ақылды","def":"Stefan Hell's a clever man.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/a31a61e94f37.mp3"},{"en":"kind","ru":"добрый","kk":"мейірімді","def":"She's a very kind person.","img":null,"audio":"/learning/audio/a0/0ef25ae00f40.mp3"},{"en":"quiet","ru":"тихий","kk":"тыныш","def":"Timur is a quiet man.","img":"/course/a0/img/l17-quiet.jpg","audio":"/learning/audio/a0/58bdb05d89f5.mp3"},{"en":"nice","ru":"приятный","kk":"жағымды","def":"Vienna's a nice city.","img":null,"audio":null}]},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Stefan Hell's a","after":"man.","answers":["clever"],"bank":["tall","quiet","clever"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Morocco's a","after":"country.","answers":["friendly"],"bank":["short","friendly","funny"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Birdman's a","after":"film.","answers":["funny"],"bank":["kind","funny","old"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"phrases","title":"Послушайте два предложения.","sub":"Два способа сказать одно и то же.","items":[{"text":"She has long black hair.","src":null},{"text":"She's got long black hair.","src":null}]},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"has / is при описании людей","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Предложение</th><th>Для чего</th></tr><tr><td>has</td><td>She has green eyes.</td><td>parts of the body</td></tr><tr><td>has got</td><td>She's got long hair.</td><td>the same, more spoken</td></tr><tr><td>is</td><td>She is tall.</td><td>tall, young, kind, funny</td></tr></table><p>Для волос и глаз — <b>has</b> или <b>has got</b>.</p><p>Для tall, young, friendly, quiet — <b>is</b>.</p><p>Не смешивайте: «She has tall» — неверно.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Порядок слов","sub":"","html":"<table class=\"cp-table\"><tr><th></th><th>Фраза</th><th>Порядок</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>a tall young man</td><td>size → age → person</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>long black hair</td><td>length → colour → thing</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>a nice quiet city</td><td>opinion → quality → thing</td></tr></table><p>Описательные слова стоят <b>перед</b> существительным, не после.</p><p>Размер и возраст — перед цветом: a tall young man, long black hair.</p><p>К ним не добавляется <b>-s</b>: two tall men.</p><p class=\"cp-note__fwd\">very и really усиливают: really long hair.</p>"},{"stage":"Grammar","type":"note","title":"Смотрите и слушайте.","sub":"","html":"","examples":["She has long black hair.","He's a tall young man.","They have white faces.","My neighbours are lovely people.","Vienna's a nice city.","She's got really long hair."]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"She ___ green eyes.","options":["is","has","are"],"answer":"has","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"He ___ tall.","options":["has","have","is"],"answer":"is","why":"Tall — с is.","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное слово.","sub":"","prompt":"They ___ very friendly.","options":["are","have","has"],"answer":"are","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"Внешность или характер?","sub":"","columns":["Как выглядит","Какой характер"],"items":[{"text":"long hair","col":0},{"text":"friendly","col":1},{"text":"clever","col":1},{"text":"tall","col":0},{"text":"green eyes","col":0},{"text":"quiet","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["She has hair black long.","She has long black hair."],"answer":"She has long black hair.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["He's a tall young man.","He's a man tall young."],"answer":"He's a tall young man.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"choice","title":"Выберите правильное предложение.","sub":"","prompt":"","options":["They are two talls men.","They are two tall men."],"answer":"They are two tall men.","why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"He's got","after":"eyes.","answers":["green"],"bank":["greens","green's","green"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"She's a","after":"young woman.","answers":["nice"],"bank":["nices","nice","nicely"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"gap","title":"Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"My grandmother","after":"very kind.","answers":["is"],"bank":["have","has","is"],"why":"","html":"","src":null},{"stage":"Practice","type":"cols","title":"has или is?","sub":"","columns":["She has…","She is…"],"items":[{"text":"green eyes","col":0},{"text":"a white face","col":0},{"text":"tall","col":1},{"text":"friendly","col":1},{"text":"long hair","col":0},{"text":"young","col":1}]},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["long","She","black","hair.","has"],"answer":"She has long black hair.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["tall","man.","He","a","is","young"],"answer":"He is a tall young man.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"order","title":"Расставьте слова по порядку.","sub":"","words":["neighbours","people.","lovely","My","are"],"answer":"My neighbours are lovely people.","why":""},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["She","has","tall."],"bad":1,"answer":"She is tall.","why":"Tall — с is, а не has."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["He's","a","man","young."],"bad":3,"answer":"He's a young man.","why":"Описательное слово стоит перед существительным."},{"stage":"Practice","type":"mistake","title":"Найдите ошибку.","sub":"Нажмите на неправильное слово.","tokens":["They","have","whites","faces."],"bad":2,"answer":"They have white faces.","why":"К описательным словам -s не добавляется."},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Стефан Хелль —","src":"/course/a0/audio/991530c1912f.mp3","options":["a funny man","a clever man","a tall man"],"answer":"a clever man","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"Vienna's a","after":"city.","answers":["nice"],"bank":["nice","big","new"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/47832bdbc0ba.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Марокко —","src":"/course/a0/audio/43b13e6608f2.mp3","options":["a friendly country","a big country","a quiet country"],"answer":"a friendly country","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какого цвета их волосы?","src":"/course/a0/audio/f61f7565ec9c.mp3","options":["white","black","red"],"answer":"black","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"listen","title":"Послушайте. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какого цвета их лица?","src":"/course/a0/audio/f61f7565ec9c.mp3","options":["white","black","red"],"answer":"white","html":""},{"stage":"Listening","type":"gap","title":"Послушайте. Дополните предложение.","sub":"","before":"They put flowers on top of their","after":".","answers":["heads"],"bank":["heads","hands","faces"],"src":"/course/a0/audio/f61f7565ec9c.mp3"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"note","title":"Прочитайте про друзей Зары.","sub":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>"},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Ainur has long hair.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"True","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"True или False?","sub":"","prompt":"Timur has black eyes.","options":["True","False"],"answer":"False","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Listening","type":"choice","title":"Прочитайте ещё раз. Выберите правильный ответ.","sub":"","prompt":"Какой Тимур по характеру?","options":["Tall and young","Quiet and friendly","Funny and clever"],"answer":"Quiet and friendly","why":"","html":"<p class=\"cp-who\">Zara</p><p>Hi! I'm Zara. This is a photo of my two friends.</p><p>Ainur is tall and she has long black hair.</p><p>Timur is a quiet, friendly man. He has green eyes.</p><p>They're really funny people. I like them a lot.</p>","src":null},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"write","title":"Опишите двух людей.","sub":"Одно — что у них есть, другое — какие они.","placeholder":"","html":"<ul class=\"cp-frames\"><li>My ___ has ___ hair.</li><li>She is ___ and ___ .</li><li>He's a ___ young man.</li></ul><div class=\"cp-note__chips\"><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">has</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">is</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">long</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">short</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">black</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">green eyes</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">tall</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">good-looking</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">friendly</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">quiet</span><span class=\"cp-note__chip\">funny</span></div>","modelHtml":"<ul class=\"cp-checks\"><li>Для волос и глаз я использовал(а) <b>has</b>.</li><li>Для tall, friendly, quiet — <b>is</b>.</li><li>Описательные слова стоят перед существительным.</li></ul>"},{"stage":"Speaking","type":"record","title":"Произнесите предложения. Запишите и послушайте.","sub":"Сначала послушайте каждое предложение.","items":["She has long black hair.","He is a tall young man.","They are very friendly.","My sister is really funny."]},{"stage":"Wrap","type":"checklist","title":"Урок 17 пройден","sub":"Урок 17 из 24 · Юнит 5","items":["Я могу описать внешность человека.","Я могу описать характер.","Я могу поставить описательные слова по порядку."]}]}
